{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029043556029-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029084816\"/><p>傷者送院救治。</p><p>青衣發生工業意外。航運路36號一物流中心，今日(29日)凌晨3時41分，一名姓盧(39歲)男工人，在一輛中型貨車工作期間，懷疑失平衡跌出車外，墮下約1米地面，同事見狀代為報案。事主背、腰及手部受傷，清醒由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院救治。警員經調查後，案件列「工業意外有人意外受傷」，交相關部門跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:45.201974+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T20:35:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.327229+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:59:09.496312+00:00","content_hash":"c35a2a279d7ef4e42c3f163c57ebe9d0f8041f56c003ec104c562612f5581e0c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:45.201974+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}